        {
          "text": "Sanoa, Adulamu, ea gharang'weaka nyaawa, Lakishi ea madameagaaschi, Aseka ea gharang'weakaaschi. Hean gawus iing'eada Beer-sheba ea ghwahita moangoachiyda Hinomu. ",
